All snakemake commands need to be executed were summarized in /gpfs/projects/b1042/epifluidlab/yoshii/scnomehic_paper/benchmark/snmCAT/mapping_brain/snakemake/snakemake_cmd.txt
You need to execute them based on the computational environment you have (e.g., use a job scheduler or run locally).
Once all commands are executed successfully, use 'yap summary' to generate final mapping summary.
